WEBVTT

01:30.480 --> 01:31.440
Since you won't help

01:31.600 --> 01:32.520
I'll do it then.

01:33.080 --> 01:34.080
Since you don't wanna get involved in,

01:34.080 --> 01:34.840
I'll step up instead.

01:35.160 --> 01:36.600
I'll make sure you stay out of it.

01:36.800 --> 01:37.800
Is that okay?

01:38.200 --> 01:38.720
Chen Yi.

01:40.039 --> 01:40.680
I'm here.

01:41.400 --> 01:43.000
See Miss Gu home safely.

01:52.720 --> 01:54.120
Miss Gu is strange...

01:54.759 --> 01:56.440
You also think so?

01:57.160 --> 01:59.400
She's always respectful to you.

01:59.920 --> 02:00.720
But today...

02:01.000 --> 02:02.040
it's like she comes here

02:02.160 --> 02:03.400
to have a quarrel.

02:04.480 --> 02:05.600
I reckon she's on purpose.

02:08.520 --> 02:10.240
She wanna save Mrs. Nie and Xiangyun

02:10.639 --> 02:11.640
And she knows I

02:12.200 --> 02:12.920
have my reservations.

02:13.560 --> 02:14.440
So she took this chance

02:14.440 --> 02:15.440
to have a quarrel with me

02:15.880 --> 02:17.320
and let the whole matter drop.

02:19.600 --> 02:20.720
If Miss Gu

02:20.800 --> 02:22.440
planned it in this way,

02:23.079 --> 02:24.560
she's really thoughtful.

02:44.160 --> 02:44.840
Yes,

02:45.320 --> 02:46.120
she is.

02:46.800 --> 02:47.920
With this quarrel,

02:48.040 --> 02:49.120
Mr. Chen is finally separated

02:49.120 --> 02:50.440
from the whole affair.

02:50.840 --> 02:51.600
Yep.

02:52.000 --> 02:52.880
But I haven't thought

02:53.480 --> 02:54.200
Lord Nie

02:54.360 --> 02:56.280
angered Mr. Chen on purpose.

02:56.640 --> 02:57.320
Miss Gu...

02:59.640 --> 03:00.200
Is...

03:00.800 --> 03:01.720
Isn't this

03:02.040 --> 03:03.280
the crime of deceit?

03:03.440 --> 03:04.240
Don't ever

03:04.520 --> 03:05.400
mention this again.

03:05.880 --> 03:06.720
Keep it to yourself.

03:07.040 --> 03:07.800
Yes, Miss.

03:08.400 --> 03:09.280
How about

03:09.400 --> 03:10.240
Mrs. Nie?

03:10.440 --> 03:11.880
I found an old colleague of Lord Nie

03:11.880 --> 03:13.160
from his days at Tongzhou Garrison

03:13.160 --> 03:14.400
Mr. Lv.

03:14.560 --> 03:16.360
He runs an embroidery workshop.

03:16.720 --> 03:17.800
His family fell on hard times

03:17.960 --> 03:18.520
but with fifty taels

03:18.520 --> 03:20.120
Lord Nie gave him back then

03:20.120 --> 03:20.960
as startup capital,

03:21.120 --> 03:22.360
he managed to build up the business.

03:22.640 --> 03:24.000
I told him about

03:24.240 --> 03:24.800
Mrs. Nie's plight

03:25.200 --> 03:26.400
and Mr. Lv

03:26.400 --> 03:27.600
agreed to help

03:27.760 --> 03:28.720
right away.

03:28.960 --> 03:29.760
He wanna hire Mrs. Nie

03:29.760 --> 03:31.240
as an instructor at his workshop

03:31.520 --> 03:32.920
with room and board provided

03:33.160 --> 03:34.760
and one more tael every month.

03:35.120 --> 03:36.000
Does Mrs. Nie

03:36.320 --> 03:37.120
agree?

03:37.280 --> 03:39.079
She's sensible

03:39.400 --> 03:41.000
She said yes the moment I told her.

03:41.520 --> 03:42.160
Tomorrow,

03:42.160 --> 03:42.760
I'll have men

03:42.760 --> 03:44.040
secretly send her and her daughter

03:44.040 --> 03:45.720
to the backyard behind the workshop.

03:46.000 --> 03:47.160
The Nies will never

03:47.360 --> 03:48.120
find them.

03:48.360 --> 03:49.360
Great.

03:50.160 --> 03:51.000
This settles

03:51.160 --> 03:52.360
one of my biggest wishes.

03:52.680 --> 03:53.440
Thank you, Mr. Ping.

03:53.440 --> 03:54.360
You're welcome.

04:00.080 --> 04:00.800
Aunt,

04:01.600 --> 04:03.320
these are premium fried crisp rolls.

04:03.640 --> 04:04.440
Fermented bean curd of Jin's

04:04.560 --> 04:05.760
are in these jars.

04:06.080 --> 04:06.800
These

04:06.800 --> 04:08.200
are all your favorites.

04:08.560 --> 04:09.840
I specially brought them for you.

04:10.240 --> 04:11.200
Once you eat them up,

04:11.400 --> 04:12.960
just let me know.

04:13.160 --> 04:14.400
I'll have more delivered right away.

04:14.760 --> 04:16.160
Alright, alright.

04:18.200 --> 04:19.760
These are top-grade pine soot ink

04:20.160 --> 04:21.399
and Writing Brush from Huzhou.

04:21.720 --> 04:23.560
These are for Uncle.

04:24.000 --> 04:25.040
You can keep them,

04:25.320 --> 04:26.360
or send to others as gifts.

04:26.720 --> 04:27.680
Either way, they're perfect.

04:29.320 --> 04:30.240
Inside this big chest

04:30.680 --> 04:31.400
are all the fabrics

04:31.440 --> 04:32.360
Grandma picked out

04:32.360 --> 04:33.200
for Jinzhao.

04:33.960 --> 04:35.040
She asked me to bring them along.

04:38.880 --> 04:39.760
Good.

04:41.520 --> 04:42.120
Very good.

04:44.320 --> 04:45.600
We're family.

04:45.840 --> 04:47.440
You've come to the capital to study,

04:47.440 --> 04:48.800
and we should look after you.

04:49.280 --> 04:49.960
Yet you

04:50.400 --> 04:52.159
bring so many gifts.

04:53.000 --> 04:54.400
We're family.

04:54.840 --> 04:55.640
No need for such formality.

04:59.760 --> 05:00.480
Tonight,

05:00.880 --> 05:02.160
treat Mr. Ji

05:02.320 --> 05:03.840
with a slap-up meal

05:03.960 --> 05:05.120
at Baiweiju Restaurant.

05:07.040 --> 05:07.680
Okay.

05:09.120 --> 05:10.520
By the way, where's Jinzhao?

05:11.440 --> 05:12.520
There's business today

05:12.520 --> 05:13.400
and she goes to do with it.

05:13.880 --> 05:15.440
Fetch her back at once.

05:15.760 --> 05:16.880
Mr. Ji is here.

05:17.840 --> 05:18.280
Okay.

05:18.640 --> 05:19.440
No hurry.

05:26.120 --> 05:26.760
Nanny,

05:27.080 --> 05:28.280
go check out the front.

05:28.360 --> 05:29.440
As soon as Jinzhao's back,

05:29.800 --> 05:30.880
tell her to come over quickly.

05:31.320 --> 05:31.800
Okay.

05:43.159 --> 05:44.280
Aunt,

05:44.920 --> 05:46.240
there're some books on my carriage.

05:46.400 --> 05:47.400
I don't trust the servants with them.

05:47.640 --> 05:48.200
I need to go check.

05:48.320 --> 05:48.800
Alright.

05:48.960 --> 05:49.840
Suit yourself.

05:50.120 --> 05:51.159
Once you're settled,

05:51.280 --> 05:52.000
let nanny take you

05:52.000 --> 05:53.000
to the guest quarters.

05:53.400 --> 05:54.840
You must be worn out

05:54.840 --> 05:55.680
from the long journey.

05:55.800 --> 05:56.320
Thanks.

06:04.160 --> 06:05.000
Ji!

06:09.160 --> 06:10.080
What's wrong?

06:10.480 --> 06:11.440
Why do you come alone?

06:11.640 --> 06:12.440
Where's Grandma?

06:13.360 --> 06:14.920
She's at home.

06:15.760 --> 06:17.080
Is she ill?

06:18.680 --> 06:20.400
I heard lots of trouble broke out at home

06:20.720 --> 06:21.880
because of the land equalization.

06:22.240 --> 06:23.080
She's fine.

06:23.240 --> 06:24.160
Don't worry.

06:24.640 --> 06:25.080
Really?

06:25.200 --> 06:26.120
Don't lie to me.

06:30.440 --> 06:31.720
She's really fine.

06:32.440 --> 06:33.200
In a few days,

06:33.480 --> 06:34.159
she'll come to the capital

06:34.159 --> 06:35.640
to deliver Yulin Tuce herself.

06:35.800 --> 06:36.640
Keep it secret.

06:36.960 --> 06:37.640
Really?

06:38.480 --> 06:39.280
So...

06:39.520 --> 06:40.680
Has the land equalization finished?

06:41.640 --> 06:42.400
Great!

06:44.240 --> 06:44.800
Ji,

06:44.800 --> 06:45.520
you must be tired.

06:45.800 --> 06:46.920
Let me take you to have a rest.

06:47.400 --> 06:47.920
No need.

06:48.040 --> 06:49.720
I...I can go by myself.

06:50.480 --> 06:51.520
What happened to you?

06:51.880 --> 06:53.159
You've had your coming-of-age ceremony.

06:53.960 --> 06:54.720
So...

06:55.000 --> 06:55.680
what?

06:56.680 --> 06:58.159
Does that mean

06:58.440 --> 06:59.280
we can't

06:59.480 --> 07:00.360
be together?

07:01.000 --> 07:02.320
Where did you pick up such stuffy old-fashioned talk?

07:02.960 --> 07:03.880
Stuffy talk?

07:04.600 --> 07:05.880
You're a lady now,

07:06.200 --> 07:07.480
and we're not in Tongzhou.

07:07.920 --> 07:08.840
I'm only doing this

07:09.560 --> 07:10.640
for your own good.

07:11.640 --> 07:12.680
You're grown up.

07:13.160 --> 07:13.920
Time to be sensible.

07:14.760 --> 07:15.240
Enough.

07:15.640 --> 07:16.400
I'm leaving.

07:23.600 --> 07:24.360
Miss,

07:25.000 --> 07:26.040
what Mr. Ji said does make sense.

07:26.480 --> 07:27.480
Don't be upset.

07:28.120 --> 07:28.800
I'm not.

07:30.360 --> 07:31.760
I know he means well.

07:32.440 --> 07:33.320
But in fact,

07:33.640 --> 07:34.560
he's not just for my sake.

07:35.320 --> 07:36.480
He's really afraid Grandma

07:36.480 --> 07:37.480
will marry me off to him.

07:39.400 --> 07:40.680
As if I'd ever marry him!

07:41.400 --> 07:42.600
Thinks he's such a catch.

07:46.440 --> 07:47.720
Cunshan Academy

07:48.120 --> 07:50.040
is famed as No.1 in the capital.

07:50.520 --> 07:52.400
It's not easy to study there.

07:52.800 --> 07:54.080
Getting admitted

07:54.680 --> 07:56.080
is quite an achievement.

07:56.440 --> 07:58.240
It's all thanks to Xuruo.

07:58.440 --> 07:59.880
Had he not written me a recommendation letter,

07:59.880 --> 08:00.680
I'd never get admitted.

08:01.480 --> 08:02.600
Xuruo?

08:03.080 --> 08:04.240
Mr. Chen's nephew,

08:04.400 --> 08:05.200
Chen Xuanqing.

08:10.400 --> 08:11.400
Ji,

08:11.680 --> 08:13.880
you'll be schoolmates with Xuanqing?

08:14.440 --> 08:15.880
He's done you such a big favor.

08:16.320 --> 08:17.520
We must prepare a generous gift

08:17.520 --> 08:18.680
to thank him.

08:19.440 --> 08:20.480
Grandma has got it ready.

08:20.760 --> 08:21.880
I'll take it

08:21.880 --> 08:22.520
when registering tomorrow.

08:23.160 --> 08:23.680
Okay.

08:24.240 --> 08:25.000
Ji,

08:25.160 --> 08:26.480
you're going to the academy tomorrow?

08:28.120 --> 08:28.880
I'll go with you.

08:29.360 --> 08:30.200
What for?

08:31.440 --> 08:32.400
To see you off.

08:33.120 --> 08:34.440
As your younger sister,

08:34.440 --> 08:35.320
I should send you off

08:35.440 --> 08:36.360
to study in the capital.

08:38.080 --> 08:39.360
Jinzhao's right.

08:39.360 --> 08:40.720
If my health weren't so frail,

08:41.200 --> 08:42.840
I'd also go see you off.

08:44.600 --> 08:46.440
Let's talk over dinner.

08:47.040 --> 08:48.120
Okay.

08:48.560 --> 08:49.040
Mr. Ji,

08:49.600 --> 08:50.080
cheers.

08:50.880 --> 08:51.720
Jinzhao.

08:52.640 --> 08:53.480
I can reach it.

08:54.400 --> 08:55.760
What a future pillar of the nation!

09:00.280 --> 09:01.520
What are you doing, mom?

09:01.760 --> 09:03.040
We were having dinner.

09:03.200 --> 09:04.080
Why did you pinch me?

09:05.120 --> 09:06.360
So you felt it huh?

09:06.640 --> 09:07.840
I thought you wouldn't notice.

09:08.880 --> 09:09.920
Of course I noticed.

09:10.160 --> 09:11.040
I also know

09:11.040 --> 09:12.320
you pinched me to make me

09:12.320 --> 09:13.560
go with Jinzhao and Brother Ji

09:13.560 --> 09:14.600
to the academy together.

09:14.840 --> 09:16.120
You know it, but still play dumb.

09:16.360 --> 09:17.320
Cause' I don't wanna go.

09:17.840 --> 09:19.040
Why not?

09:19.160 --> 09:20.200
It's such a great chance.

09:20.760 --> 09:21.800
Mr. Ji is close

09:21.800 --> 09:23.120
with Chen Xuanqing.

09:23.520 --> 09:25.560
You know Xuanqing well.

09:25.960 --> 09:26.800
If you go along,

09:26.960 --> 09:27.880
and spend time with him

09:28.240 --> 09:29.760
after a few meetings,

09:30.040 --> 09:31.280
something might come of it.

09:32.760 --> 09:34.040
Come of what?

09:34.360 --> 09:35.560
It's Jinzhao who likes

09:35.560 --> 09:36.600
Xuanqing,

09:36.720 --> 09:37.880
not me.

09:39.160 --> 09:39.840
What?

09:40.920 --> 09:42.240
Jinzhao fancies Chen Xuanqing?

09:42.880 --> 09:43.680
Exactly.

09:45.640 --> 09:46.840
She told you?

09:47.240 --> 09:48.320
No need.

09:48.800 --> 09:49.880
It's as plain as day,

09:49.880 --> 09:50.800
impossible to miss.

09:51.280 --> 09:52.280
I've known it for a long time.

09:53.200 --> 09:54.680
No wonder Mrs. Ji

09:55.400 --> 09:56.680
cozies up to the Chen.

09:57.320 --> 09:58.960
So that's what she's after.

10:00.120 --> 10:01.200
Though Chen Xuanqing

10:01.480 --> 10:02.520
bears the Chen surname,

10:02.800 --> 10:04.040
he is just adopted.

10:05.760 --> 10:07.160
What he will achieve

10:07.320 --> 10:08.240
is still uncertain.

10:08.640 --> 10:09.120
Exactly.

10:12.560 --> 10:13.280
Lan,

10:13.680 --> 10:15.400
I know you have no interest

10:15.400 --> 10:16.120
in Chen Xuanqing.

10:16.440 --> 10:17.200
I won't force you.

10:17.600 --> 10:18.640
But you need to understand

10:18.960 --> 10:20.680
anyone admitted to Cunshan Academy

10:20.800 --> 10:22.240
is not ordinary.

10:22.400 --> 10:23.520
You're soon to come of age.

10:23.760 --> 10:25.120
Go along tomorrow,

10:25.280 --> 10:26.560
and you might meet a good match.

10:26.920 --> 10:27.720
No.

10:28.920 --> 10:30.200
My destiny

10:30.760 --> 10:31.480
doesn't lie

10:31.480 --> 10:32.560
in some academy.

10:33.120 --> 10:33.720
You...

10:42.880 --> 10:43.560
How's he?

10:45.600 --> 10:46.280
He's recovered well

10:47.600 --> 10:49.440
and out of danger now.

10:50.040 --> 10:51.800
The prescription from the earlier doctor

10:51.840 --> 10:52.680
suits his illness.

10:53.040 --> 10:53.960
Just keep taking it.

10:54.960 --> 10:55.600
However,

10:55.640 --> 10:56.800
his heart condition is treacherous.

10:57.240 --> 10:58.440
From now on, Mr. Ye

10:58.560 --> 10:59.840
must carry his medicine at all times.

10:59.960 --> 11:00.840
Don't neglect it.

11:02.240 --> 11:03.040
Thank you.

11:03.560 --> 11:04.920
I shall take my leave then.

11:09.680 --> 11:10.520
It seems that

11:11.080 --> 11:12.840
Doctor Xiao's medicine works best.

11:13.240 --> 11:14.160
This works well too.

11:14.640 --> 11:16.280
With the Imperial Medical Academy's confirmation,

11:16.640 --> 11:17.480
we'll have

11:17.800 --> 11:18.560
a proper reason

11:18.560 --> 11:20.040
to get out of the Eastern Palace.

11:20.520 --> 11:21.280
What?

11:22.600 --> 11:23.960
You want me to leave?

11:24.240 --> 11:26.080
I've heard Chen Yanyun is strict.

11:26.400 --> 11:27.960
He pushes you to study nonstop,

11:28.320 --> 11:29.840
and has you flogged at every turn.

11:30.560 --> 11:32.200
Seeing your hands all bruised last time

11:32.520 --> 11:33.880
tore my heart apart.

11:34.680 --> 11:36.600
The Crown Prince is destined to rule.

11:36.840 --> 11:38.320
You don't need to sit the imperial exam.

11:38.760 --> 11:39.840
Our Marquis Manor

11:40.080 --> 11:41.280
has only you as the sole heir.

11:42.080 --> 11:42.800
How can we bear

11:42.800 --> 11:43.960
seeing you suffer like this?

11:46.160 --> 11:47.320
Come back, okay?

11:48.920 --> 11:49.520
I'm not coming back.

11:49.800 --> 11:50.240
Why must you

11:50.240 --> 11:51.680
insist on staying in the Palace?

11:52.640 --> 11:53.400
But I've already

11:53.400 --> 11:54.400
talked to your dad about this.

11:54.400 --> 11:55.400
Then go tell him again.

11:55.720 --> 11:56.640
I'm not leaving anyway.

11:57.240 --> 11:57.680
But...

11:57.680 --> 11:58.440
No buts.

12:00.280 --> 12:01.160
Please take your leave, mom.

12:02.560 --> 12:03.560
I have a headache.

12:25.520 --> 12:26.000
My Lord,

12:26.360 --> 12:28.040
when your heart ailment flared up,

12:28.040 --> 12:28.920
it was all thanks to Miss Gu

12:28.920 --> 12:29.720
who saved you.

12:30.200 --> 12:30.800
Shouldn't we

12:30.880 --> 12:33.000
go thank her?

12:35.400 --> 12:36.360
You sly lad.

12:36.720 --> 12:38.040
You look honest and plain,

12:38.280 --> 12:39.280
yet you're quite sharp.

12:40.880 --> 12:42.000
But you're right.

12:42.480 --> 12:43.400
I, Ye Xian,

12:43.600 --> 12:45.080
never leave a kindness unpaid.

12:46.520 --> 12:47.640
Prepare a gift tomorrow.

12:48.160 --> 12:49.400
I'll call on the Gu residence.

12:50.760 --> 12:51.360
Okay.

13:04.840 --> 13:05.880
Greetings, Mr. Ye.

13:06.080 --> 13:07.400
My respects, Mr. Ye.

13:08.320 --> 13:09.240
Is Gu Jinzhao here?

13:09.520 --> 13:10.280
Let her come out.

13:10.560 --> 13:11.680
I have words to say to her.

13:14.000 --> 13:14.840
What a pity!

13:14.960 --> 13:16.640
Miss Gu has gone to the academy.

13:17.040 --> 13:17.760
Academy?

13:18.840 --> 13:19.640
Cousin Ji is

13:19.640 --> 13:21.080
enrolling at Cunshan Academy.

13:21.200 --> 13:22.200
He's registering today.

13:22.360 --> 13:24.280
My mom asked her to go along.

13:26.080 --> 13:26.880
Why?

13:28.800 --> 13:30.120
I have no idea.

13:30.440 --> 13:32.640
Maybe now that she's come of age,

13:32.640 --> 13:33.400
she needs to socialize more

13:33.400 --> 13:34.560
and go out in society.

13:37.880 --> 13:38.960
Socialize, indeed.

13:40.040 --> 13:41.080
Going to a place full of young men

13:41.280 --> 13:42.920
perfect for seeking a marriage match.

13:44.320 --> 13:45.520
Please don't put it that way.

13:51.080 --> 13:51.680
My Lord,

13:52.000 --> 13:52.560
should we head to

13:52.560 --> 13:54.000
Cunshan Academy for Miss Gu?

13:54.880 --> 13:55.640
Why would I go looking for her?

13:56.480 --> 13:57.360
Am I that bored?

13:58.000 --> 13:58.720
Didn't you say

13:58.720 --> 13:59.960
you wanted to repay her kindness?

14:07.840 --> 14:08.680
Who said I wanna repay her?

14:16.760 --> 14:17.240
Forget it.

14:18.200 --> 14:18.720
In a few days,

14:18.720 --> 14:19.800
send her an invitation.

14:20.280 --> 14:21.120
Tell her

14:22.440 --> 14:23.520
I'm inviting her to dine with me.

14:25.920 --> 14:26.440
Yes, my Lord.

14:27.200 --> 14:27.720
Giddy up!

14:28.200 --> 14:28.760
Giddy up!

14:40.000 --> 14:41.520
What lovely scenery!

14:42.000 --> 14:43.600
Truly an ideal place for studying.

14:43.920 --> 14:45.320
It calms the mind and lifts the spirit.

14:46.760 --> 14:47.400
Yes.

14:47.840 --> 14:49.520
When the old academy head chose the site,

14:49.680 --> 14:51.440
he picked it at once for its hills and rivers.

14:52.120 --> 14:53.360
He also sent for craftsmen

14:53.360 --> 14:54.440
all the way from Suzhou to design it.

14:55.000 --> 14:56.680
It took five years to complete.

14:57.080 --> 14:57.800
No wonder.

14:58.120 --> 14:58.800
If only I could

14:58.800 --> 15:00.000
study in such a

15:00.000 --> 15:01.040
wonderful place like this.

15:01.400 --> 15:02.000
I agree.

15:02.480 --> 15:03.320
So many women in the world

15:03.480 --> 15:05.040
are full of knowledge and talent,

15:05.200 --> 15:06.160
yet held back by old customs.

15:06.720 --> 15:07.760
To be honest, Miss Gu,

15:07.960 --> 15:09.360
the academy head has two daughters.

15:10.040 --> 15:11.280
He's long wanted

15:11.520 --> 15:12.640
to find a proper place

15:12.800 --> 15:13.560
and open a school for girls.

15:13.840 --> 15:14.640
Really?

15:15.000 --> 15:16.080
When that happens,

15:16.280 --> 15:17.680
please remember

15:17.760 --> 15:18.520
to let me know.

15:20.040 --> 15:21.000
I'm at the academy too.

15:21.520 --> 15:22.320
If you want to know something,

15:22.320 --> 15:23.320
I can tell you myself.

15:23.720 --> 15:24.680
No need to trouble Xuruo.

15:24.960 --> 15:25.640
You?

15:26.120 --> 15:27.320
By the time you tell me,

15:27.520 --> 15:28.920
the school will have opened,

15:29.160 --> 15:30.560
and all spots taken.

15:30.640 --> 15:31.600
What do you mean?

15:31.600 --> 15:32.280
Do you think

15:32.480 --> 15:33.920
I'd stand in your way

15:33.920 --> 15:35.120
and stop you from learning?

15:35.600 --> 15:36.760
I wouldn't put it past you.

15:37.080 --> 15:37.880
Two years ago,

15:37.880 --> 15:39.560
I found a nice shop in Baoping.

15:40.320 --> 15:41.520
I just didn't have enough money that day.

15:41.680 --> 15:43.080
I'd settled with the owner

15:43.280 --> 15:44.640
to come back the next day.

15:44.920 --> 15:45.600
But then what happened?

15:45.760 --> 15:48.000
You rented it for yourself

15:48.160 --> 15:49.360
with 10% more.

15:50.160 --> 15:50.760
Knowing how you love

15:50.760 --> 15:51.840
spoiling things for others for no reason,

15:51.840 --> 15:52.240
I...

15:52.360 --> 15:53.560
who knows what you might do next.

15:54.400 --> 15:55.360
I rented that shop

15:55.360 --> 15:56.360
for the Ji's own good.

15:56.720 --> 15:57.560
Besides,

15:57.760 --> 15:58.160
you only sell

15:58.240 --> 15:59.480
rouge and cosmetics anyway.

15:59.600 --> 16:00.880
Did you really need such a great shop?

16:01.160 --> 16:02.360
What I sell is none of your business.

16:02.600 --> 16:03.520
Snatching what I'm keen on

16:03.640 --> 16:04.840
is simply bad manners.

16:05.120 --> 16:05.840
- I...
- You guys

16:06.440 --> 16:07.000
Inside there

16:07.000 --> 16:08.400
is the reception hall.

16:11.240 --> 16:12.520
Sorry for the quarrel, Xuruo.

16:12.720 --> 16:13.880
We'll go pay our respects now.

16:16.080 --> 16:17.040
Mr. Chen,

16:18.280 --> 16:19.560
I'll wait for you over there.

16:19.800 --> 16:21.240
Please take Mr. Ji in.

16:22.120 --> 16:22.960
He always

16:23.160 --> 16:24.760
speaks his mind without restraint.

16:24.960 --> 16:26.080
I'd be grateful if you

16:26.280 --> 16:27.440
could look after him.

16:28.680 --> 16:29.920
There's a pavilion ahead.

16:30.080 --> 16:30.960
If you are tired,

16:31.120 --> 16:31.920
you can rest there.

16:32.520 --> 16:33.040
Thank you.

16:33.800 --> 16:34.360
Let's go.

16:46.160 --> 16:48.960
With gentle breeze and verdant hills,

16:49.200 --> 16:52.000
nothing blocks the white clouds flying free.

16:53.920 --> 16:55.560
Mr. Chen wrote this?

17:02.040 --> 17:02.800
Miss Gu.

17:39.360 --> 17:40.280
Mr. Chen?

17:40.800 --> 17:42.040
Why are you alone?

17:43.160 --> 17:44.240
Where's Ji?

17:45.640 --> 17:46.720
The academy head is testing him.

17:47.200 --> 17:48.360
It's not proper for me to stay there,

17:48.600 --> 17:49.440
so I stepped out.

17:52.880 --> 17:54.040
Your calligraphy

17:54.400 --> 17:55.600
is truly exquisite.

17:56.080 --> 17:57.200
The charm and spirit in it

17:57.760 --> 18:00.240
resemble your father quite a lot.

18:00.840 --> 18:01.480
I have indeed studied calligraphy

18:01.480 --> 18:02.600
from my father all these years.

18:02.840 --> 18:03.960
Yet even after long practice,

18:04.400 --> 18:05.480
I still fall far short of his skill.

18:05.840 --> 18:07.400
You're too modest.

18:07.640 --> 18:09.000
Looking at all the works on this wall,

18:09.240 --> 18:10.960
yours is the best.

18:12.640 --> 18:13.680
So your father likes to

18:14.360 --> 18:16.400
copy Liu Gongquan's calligraphy.

18:16.920 --> 18:17.960
You have a sharp eye, Miss Gu.

18:18.880 --> 18:20.320
He admires Liu Gongquan

18:20.440 --> 18:22.160
for his open and firm temperament.

18:22.880 --> 18:23.960
He says I'm too reserved,

18:24.120 --> 18:25.280
and tells me to practice Liu's style more.

18:25.480 --> 18:26.880
Did he ever say

18:27.120 --> 18:28.200
which model to start with

18:28.440 --> 18:30.400
when learning Liu's calligraphy?

18:31.000 --> 18:32.760
Stele Inscription of Xuanmi Pagoda?

18:33.000 --> 18:34.560
He likes Vajracchedika-sutra Pagoda.

20:30.200 --> 20:31.120
Why on earth

20:31.120 --> 20:32.120
write Vajracchedika-sutra Pagoda?

20:36.320 --> 20:37.640
You're so late!

20:38.080 --> 20:39.200
Obviously you got lectured.

20:39.400 --> 20:40.080
I did not!

20:40.760 --> 20:41.680
How did your talk go

20:42.040 --> 20:42.720
with the academy head?

20:43.000 --> 20:43.840
He's very kind.

20:43.960 --> 20:44.800
He didn't say too much

20:45.280 --> 20:47.680
but gave me a quite challenging question.

20:51.000 --> 20:51.720
What question?

20:51.960 --> 20:52.600
Share with us.

20:54.800 --> 20:56.240
The question

20:57.400 --> 20:58.680
is something I've

20:59.200 --> 21:00.560
never thought about before.

21:05.800 --> 21:06.280
Did you

21:06.520 --> 21:07.080
find out anything?

21:07.360 --> 21:08.000
Yes.

21:08.280 --> 21:09.360
That rascal Luo Guier

21:09.360 --> 21:10.280
refused to tell me at first.

21:10.600 --> 21:11.480
But once I gave him

21:11.480 --> 21:12.360
half a tael of loose silver,

21:12.360 --> 21:13.280
he spilled everything.

21:13.720 --> 21:15.320
He said he didn't see much,

21:15.800 --> 21:16.600
only that when Chen Xuanqing

21:16.600 --> 21:18.080
picked them up from the academy,

21:19.080 --> 21:20.000
Miss Gu looked

21:20.000 --> 21:21.280
happier than Ji.

21:24.240 --> 21:25.960
I knew Miss Gu

21:26.000 --> 21:28.080
has her eye on Chen Xuanqing.

21:58.920 --> 21:59.520
Miss,

22:00.840 --> 22:01.360
Miss?

22:03.360 --> 22:04.120
What happened?

22:04.920 --> 22:06.360
It's been almost an hour,

22:06.360 --> 22:07.640
and you're still staring at the same page.

22:08.360 --> 22:09.680
Qingpu, let me ask you.

22:10.480 --> 22:11.440
What do you

22:12.400 --> 22:13.520
think of Chen Xuanqing?

22:14.720 --> 22:16.400
Why bring him up

22:16.400 --> 22:17.560
all of a sudden?

22:18.440 --> 22:19.440
These days,

22:19.760 --> 22:20.800
I've been thinking...

22:21.720 --> 22:23.040
If I hadn't found a way myself

22:23.040 --> 22:24.600
to get out of the marriage with Liu,

22:24.920 --> 22:26.200
I'd have been married off.

22:26.760 --> 22:27.600
Marrying into that family

22:27.600 --> 22:28.840
would be a lifetime sentence.

22:31.560 --> 22:32.520
In that household,

22:33.640 --> 22:34.680
mom's words

22:34.960 --> 22:36.000
carry no real weight.

22:36.760 --> 22:37.560
As for my dad,

22:37.680 --> 22:38.520
don't even get me started.

22:39.400 --> 22:40.040
I'd be thankful enough

22:40.040 --> 22:41.120
if he doesn't ruin my life.

22:42.840 --> 22:43.640
If I wanna

22:44.120 --> 22:45.560
live a comfortable life,

22:46.280 --> 22:47.360
I must decide

22:47.560 --> 22:48.680
my own marriage.

22:50.200 --> 22:51.200
So Miss...

22:51.360 --> 22:52.320
do you mean

22:52.680 --> 22:54.000
you fancy Xuanqing?

22:56.680 --> 22:59.320
I do think he's quite decent.

22:59.480 --> 23:00.720
What do you think, Qingpu?

23:02.320 --> 23:03.280
Well...

23:04.040 --> 23:06.280
He's the top provincial scholar,

23:06.560 --> 23:07.440
talented,

23:07.440 --> 23:08.280
and gentle in nature.

23:09.120 --> 23:11.120
But he's an adopted son.

23:11.520 --> 23:13.040
I have no idea what life

23:13.360 --> 23:14.440
is really like in the Chen Manor.

23:47.560 --> 23:48.320
No one

23:48.600 --> 23:49.800
is perfect.

23:51.480 --> 23:52.200
Miss Gu.

23:55.400 --> 23:57.040
Nanny, what brings you here so late?

23:57.760 --> 23:59.000
Greetings, Miss.

23:59.840 --> 24:01.160
Madam sent me to pass a message.

24:01.320 --> 24:03.160
Grandma will arrive in the capital tomorrow morning

24:03.600 --> 24:05.080
Madam's afraid she can't welcome her

24:05.160 --> 24:06.040
cause' she feels unwell.

24:06.320 --> 24:08.400
Miss, please go welcome on behalf of her.

24:09.040 --> 24:09.760
Great!

24:09.920 --> 24:11.040
Grandma's coming!

24:11.200 --> 24:11.720
Yes.

24:19.160 --> 24:20.000
So heavy!

24:20.320 --> 24:21.720
Why hasn't Grandma arrived yet?

24:33.320 --> 24:35.160
Wasn't she coming to deliver the Yulin Tuce?

24:35.560 --> 24:36.920
Why are there so many dead bodies?

24:37.480 --> 24:38.480
I'm afraid she's been attacked.

24:39.760 --> 24:40.840
I'll go find Grandma.

24:41.960 --> 24:42.760
I'd like to go too.

24:43.200 --> 24:43.760
Stay here.

24:44.400 --> 24:45.440
So many have been killed.

24:48.080 --> 24:49.480
Take care, Ji.

25:08.760 --> 25:09.640
Mr. Chen?

25:19.000 --> 25:19.600
Miss Gu.

25:19.760 --> 25:20.720
Mr. Chen told me to inform you

25:21.000 --> 25:22.400
Mrs. Ji is sorting the accounts,

25:22.680 --> 25:23.520
and will be out shortly.

25:24.360 --> 25:25.040
Thank you

25:25.520 --> 25:26.480
and Mr. Chen.

25:36.160 --> 25:37.200
Grandma!

25:52.800 --> 25:53.720
Grandma!

26:03.440 --> 26:04.920
Your hair has turned white...

26:06.080 --> 26:07.040
Are you alright?

26:07.120 --> 26:08.360
You scared me to death.

26:09.680 --> 26:11.160
I'm fine.

26:13.760 --> 26:15.480
My dear.

26:37.440 --> 26:37.920
Sir,

26:39.160 --> 26:40.320
this time in Tongzhou Prefecture,

26:40.640 --> 26:41.640
we oversaw Sanhe

26:41.960 --> 26:42.440
Baodi,

26:42.880 --> 26:43.440
Wuqing,

26:43.840 --> 26:44.400
Huoxian,

26:44.720 --> 26:45.480
these four counties.

26:46.080 --> 26:47.040
After land surveying in full,

26:47.320 --> 26:48.560
a total of 1,363,221 mu
[1 mu≈0.1647 acre]

26:48.880 --> 26:50.440
of farmland was registered.

26:51.360 --> 26:52.320
We compiled the Household Registers

26:52.520 --> 26:53.720
and Yulin Tuce,

26:54.160 --> 26:54.880
all storing in sixteen chests.

26:55.200 --> 26:56.280
They are all here.

26:56.640 --> 26:57.440
Please

26:57.680 --> 26:58.240
examine them.

27:00.840 --> 27:02.520
Yulin Tuce

27:04.160 --> 27:05.040
record every household's land

27:05.040 --> 27:06.600
across our Great Yan.

27:10.400 --> 27:11.560
With these records,

27:12.200 --> 27:13.480
the court can truly

27:13.480 --> 27:15.480
control all taxes and corvée nationwide.

27:15.480 --> 27:16.400
Only then do we know

27:17.000 --> 27:19.000
how much manpower and resources are needed,

27:19.000 --> 27:20.320
and where these

27:20.320 --> 27:21.480
shall be sourced.

27:21.720 --> 27:22.520
Only in this way

27:23.320 --> 27:24.600
can all lands under heaven

27:24.880 --> 27:25.880
be firmly brought

27:25.880 --> 27:28.360
under imperial rule.

27:28.520 --> 27:29.240
This is the foundation

27:29.960 --> 27:32.120
of eternal peace and governance.

27:32.120 --> 27:32.720
Great!

27:33.720 --> 27:34.680
Great!

27:35.200 --> 27:36.440
Congratulations, your Excellency

27:36.440 --> 27:37.200
Congratulations, Sir.

27:44.120 --> 27:46.160
Tongzhou has set an example

27:46.600 --> 27:47.640
for the Great Yan.

27:48.400 --> 27:49.360
You have rendered great merit.

27:49.760 --> 27:50.640
And as for

27:52.040 --> 27:52.840
Mrs. Ji,

27:53.240 --> 27:54.080
she deserves great credit.

27:54.280 --> 27:55.320
Together with all the local gentry

27:55.320 --> 27:57.000
who lent their support,

27:58.200 --> 27:59.600
grant them rewards in full.

28:02.120 --> 28:02.760
I

28:03.200 --> 28:04.040
speak on behalf of Mrs. Ji

28:04.280 --> 28:05.200
to thank you, Sir.

28:07.560 --> 28:08.520
It is only a pity...

28:08.920 --> 28:09.560
What's wrong?

28:10.600 --> 28:11.400
I cannot help

28:11.960 --> 28:13.200
thinking of Fengming.

28:20.840 --> 28:22.040
You've always been

28:24.240 --> 28:25.560
a man of loyalty and sentiment.

28:26.440 --> 28:27.440
Yet the time

28:28.560 --> 28:30.800
has not come to petition rewards for him.

28:33.280 --> 28:33.800
Yes, Sir.

28:36.080 --> 28:37.600
How goes the investigation into

28:37.600 --> 28:38.640
Your Highness' assassination?

28:39.120 --> 28:41.320
Xiao Qishan has been investigated.

28:41.440 --> 28:42.400
No report has returned.

28:42.720 --> 28:43.760
But I have given strict orders:

28:44.280 --> 28:45.400
Bring him back alive,

28:45.880 --> 28:46.960
or bring back his body.

28:48.280 --> 28:49.600
Make the search thorough.

28:51.160 --> 28:52.200
Now that

28:53.600 --> 28:55.520
His Majesty gets older,

28:56.640 --> 28:58.560
he has grown far more lenient.

28:59.200 --> 29:00.240
Prince Glorian is the

29:00.440 --> 29:02.480
late Prince Chengqing's younger brother,

29:02.640 --> 29:04.440
and His Majesty's only living sibling.

29:04.600 --> 29:05.640
To move against him,

29:07.960 --> 29:09.760
we must have irrefutable proof.

29:11.520 --> 29:12.080
Okay.

29:20.720 --> 29:21.280
You!

29:21.680 --> 29:23.520
You insolent little brute!

29:23.920 --> 29:24.640
Might as well

29:24.640 --> 29:25.600
have it put down at once.

29:26.760 --> 29:27.160
Wait!

29:29.080 --> 29:29.800
Uncle Li,

29:30.040 --> 29:31.480
it was wrong for Frost to bite you,

29:31.760 --> 29:33.040
but it just bit through your clothes.

29:33.320 --> 29:34.640
Not even a tooth mark was left.

29:34.720 --> 29:36.200
Must you be so unforgiving?

29:36.280 --> 29:37.800
You're indeed clever.

29:39.400 --> 29:40.200
Does...

29:44.320 --> 29:45.240
this mean...

29:45.400 --> 29:47.040
in your opinion,

29:47.040 --> 29:48.320
I must wait until the brute

29:48.320 --> 29:50.720
bites me till I bleed,

29:51.080 --> 29:53.440
before I may punish it?

29:53.640 --> 29:54.840
That is not what I meant.

29:56.280 --> 29:58.160
Indeed, Prince Glorian.

29:58.480 --> 29:59.280
Son of a bitch!

30:00.520 --> 30:01.000
You!

30:01.320 --> 30:03.400
I'm speaking with him.

30:03.760 --> 30:05.160
When did you get leave to interrupt?

30:06.720 --> 30:08.360
You deserve to be beaten to death.

30:08.720 --> 30:09.240
Guards!

30:09.920 --> 30:10.480
Hold on!

30:13.160 --> 30:13.920
Minister Ye!

30:22.280 --> 30:23.120
Greetings, Your Highness.

30:24.000 --> 30:24.840
Greetings, Prince Glorian.

30:26.040 --> 30:28.440
So you are the one unfit for martial arts,

30:28.440 --> 30:29.560
unable to go to the battlefield—

30:29.560 --> 30:31.040
the heir of Lord Changxing?

30:33.040 --> 30:34.720
Ye Guangsheng enjoyed a lifetime of fame.

30:35.160 --> 30:35.880
What a pity!

30:36.080 --> 30:36.920
One wonders

30:37.200 --> 30:38.400
if this is his retribution.

30:40.480 --> 30:42.160
I never thought you believed in karma.

30:42.600 --> 30:43.600
If so,

30:44.080 --> 30:46.120
the sudden death of your heir of Lord Chongguang in Tongzhou

30:47.360 --> 30:48.800
must also be your karma.

30:49.280 --> 30:49.720
You!

30:53.480 --> 30:55.280
What a sharp tongue you have!

30:55.480 --> 30:56.440
What are you doing here?

30:58.240 --> 30:59.680
Frost has been unwell.

31:00.320 --> 31:01.920
His Highness sent me to check on it.

31:02.840 --> 31:04.400
I didn't expect just as it caused trouble.

31:04.640 --> 31:05.720
May I ask where

31:06.240 --> 31:07.480
Frost bit you?

31:08.880 --> 31:09.760
Your Highness,

31:10.000 --> 31:11.280
it was by the outer wall

31:11.280 --> 31:12.880
at the north corner gate of the Eastern Palace.

31:13.160 --> 31:14.440
Frost had indigestion,

31:14.560 --> 31:16.360
and I was walking it there.

31:16.480 --> 31:17.040
Then

31:17.400 --> 31:19.160
we met Prince Glorian.

31:20.160 --> 31:21.800
The north corner gate of the Eastern Palace...

31:23.120 --> 31:24.520
It is very remote.

31:25.280 --> 31:25.960
May I ask why you

31:25.960 --> 31:27.040
went all the way out there?

31:27.760 --> 31:28.400
Yes.

31:28.920 --> 31:29.960
I almost forgot to ask.

31:30.560 --> 31:32.320
Uncle Li, why would you

31:32.960 --> 31:34.120
go outside the Eastern Palace?

31:35.680 --> 31:36.320
I

31:36.640 --> 31:38.160
entered the palace to congratulate His Majesty

31:38.360 --> 31:39.880
on the successful land equalization in Tongzhou.

31:40.200 --> 31:40.960
On my way out,

31:41.240 --> 31:42.680
I just passed by the Eastern Palace.

31:44.360 --> 31:45.400
What a fortunate "coincidence"

31:45.840 --> 31:46.960
you have!

31:47.600 --> 31:47.960
You...

31:47.960 --> 31:48.520
Yes.

31:49.360 --> 31:51.680
Uncle, coming all the way to this remote place,

31:52.200 --> 31:53.680
what business do you have here?

31:54.760 --> 31:56.080
Why did you not send word beforehand?

31:56.480 --> 31:58.480
Does my Father know your visit?

31:59.440 --> 32:01.120
I just think the weather is fine

32:01.120 --> 32:02.160
and come out for a stroll.

32:02.760 --> 32:04.040
I don't think there's a need.

32:08.640 --> 32:09.520
It is 12 o'clock.

32:10.040 --> 32:10.960
I have other affairs to attend to,

32:11.600 --> 32:12.320
and shall not waste time

32:12.320 --> 32:13.200
bickering here.

32:14.920 --> 32:16.000
Goodbye.

32:20.360 --> 32:20.920
Stand up.

32:22.800 --> 32:23.360
Ye Xian,

32:24.000 --> 32:25.440
what do you make of that old fox

32:25.560 --> 32:26.520
sneaking around

32:27.800 --> 32:29.120
outside the Eastern Palace?

32:32.000 --> 32:32.920
I dare not speculate.

32:33.320 --> 32:34.120
You dare not?

32:34.280 --> 32:34.880
Then I dare.

32:35.600 --> 32:36.640
Maybe this guy

32:36.800 --> 32:38.080
was scouting the place.

32:38.240 --> 32:38.960
Your Highness,

32:39.440 --> 32:40.040
don't...

32:40.160 --> 32:41.000
What are you afraid of?

32:41.000 --> 32:41.920
Ye Xian is one of us.

32:55.800 --> 32:56.480
Mom.

32:59.400 --> 33:00.760
Having the two of you

33:00.760 --> 33:02.080
attending to me like this,

33:02.280 --> 33:03.560
somehow I feel

33:03.560 --> 33:04.600
ill at ease.

33:05.000 --> 33:05.920
Alright, alright.

33:06.120 --> 33:07.600
Sit down and rest.

33:07.800 --> 33:09.000
Let Jinzhao rest.

33:09.160 --> 33:10.680
It has been so long since we met.

33:10.680 --> 33:11.800
I wanna attend to you and show my filial piety.

33:12.400 --> 33:13.400
I won't!

33:13.560 --> 33:14.360
I wanna stay right here

33:14.360 --> 33:15.280
and look after Grandma.

33:16.560 --> 33:17.880
Very well, dear.

33:19.040 --> 33:19.600
Mom,

33:20.520 --> 33:22.680
can you stay a few more days this time?

33:24.040 --> 33:25.360
I'm afraid not.

33:26.080 --> 33:27.800
I've come on official business.

33:28.120 --> 33:29.160
Early tomorrow morning,

33:29.160 --> 33:31.920
I need to go to the Chen Manor to visit Mr. Chen.

33:33.280 --> 33:35.840
The land equalization in Tongzhou went smoothly.

33:36.240 --> 33:39.120
Next will be Beizhili.

33:39.840 --> 33:42.040
I suspect Mr. Chen wanted me

33:42.400 --> 33:44.160
to take charge of the next task.

33:44.560 --> 33:45.520
After all,

33:45.840 --> 33:47.000
I've had the experience.

33:48.640 --> 33:49.680
But...

33:49.840 --> 33:51.480
Mr. Chen really ought not to.

33:52.200 --> 33:54.000
Land equalization is dangerous enough as it is,

33:54.560 --> 33:56.000
and you're up in years.

33:56.240 --> 33:57.880
Why treat you like an able-bodied laborer?

33:59.280 --> 34:01.320
There's no other choice.

34:02.000 --> 34:02.720
Grandma,

34:03.040 --> 34:04.760
Let me go with you tomorrow.

34:06.800 --> 34:07.640
Okay.

34:09.040 --> 34:10.239
At your age,

34:10.400 --> 34:11.360
you ought to go out

34:11.360 --> 34:12.760
and see more of the world.

34:17.080 --> 34:18.280
The land equalization in Tongzhou

34:18.440 --> 34:19.400
was a great success.

34:19.840 --> 34:21.320
When Lord Chief Councilor spoke of your merits

34:21.440 --> 34:22.480
to His Majesty,

34:23.040 --> 34:24.480
he was greatly pleased.

34:25.040 --> 34:25.760
You'll

34:26.320 --> 34:27.560
be granted official rewards shortly.

34:27.760 --> 34:28.880
I merely followed

34:28.880 --> 34:30.760
Mr. Chen's instructions.

34:31.239 --> 34:32.360
I dare not claim any credit.

34:32.639 --> 34:34.159
Lord Chief Councilor intends that

34:34.400 --> 34:35.280
one province in the south

34:35.560 --> 34:37.239
and one in the north

34:38.080 --> 34:40.440
shall be chosen for further pilot.

34:42.520 --> 34:43.320
Grandma!

34:44.520 --> 34:45.360
Jinzhao,

34:46.199 --> 34:47.679
what brings you here?

34:50.960 --> 34:51.920
Greetings, Sir.

34:52.639 --> 34:53.639
I saw Mrs. Chen

34:53.639 --> 34:54.560
growing anxious waiting,

34:54.920 --> 34:55.920
so I volunteered

34:55.920 --> 34:56.920
to come fetch you.

34:59.360 --> 35:00.920
My old friend

35:01.160 --> 35:03.160
has always been impetuous.

35:03.600 --> 35:04.240
Sir,

35:04.600 --> 35:06.520
I shall take my leave first.

35:08.400 --> 35:09.080
Okay.

35:10.880 --> 35:11.560
If I have any doubts

35:12.280 --> 35:13.320
about official affairs in days to come,

35:13.560 --> 35:14.800
I shall seek your counsel.

35:15.840 --> 35:17.400
You flatter me.

35:40.280 --> 35:41.800
Mr. Chen, your ink bamboo painting

35:42.120 --> 35:43.760
grows ever more vivid and lifelike.

35:49.160 --> 35:50.120
Sir.

35:50.720 --> 35:51.560
You're here.

35:51.840 --> 35:52.800
Come in and speak.

35:53.960 --> 35:55.440
You knew I'd come?

35:55.720 --> 35:56.880
Your manner just now

35:57.280 --> 35:58.600
shows you have something on your mind.

35:59.440 --> 36:00.640
Speak. What do you seek of me?

36:01.280 --> 36:02.560
I beg you

36:02.880 --> 36:03.960
not to send my grandma

36:03.960 --> 36:05.360
to take part in the land equalization of Beizhili.

36:12.680 --> 36:14.760
Did your grandma send you to say this?

36:15.280 --> 36:16.120
No, no, no.

36:17.560 --> 36:18.960
It is my own thoughts.

36:19.560 --> 36:20.800
Then your grandma must have

36:20.800 --> 36:22.520
spoken to you about Beizhili's affairs.

36:22.680 --> 36:23.320
Nope.

36:24.240 --> 36:25.520
She has never told me

36:25.520 --> 36:27.160
anything about land equalization.

36:27.840 --> 36:29.040
I figured it out myself.

36:30.640 --> 36:31.440
I reasoned that

36:31.640 --> 36:33.960
now that it has succeeded in Tongzhou,

36:34.120 --> 36:36.000
the next task might be Beizhili.

36:36.680 --> 36:39.520
Then it will continue south along the Grand Canal.

36:40.040 --> 36:41.320
You know far more than I expected.

36:42.240 --> 36:43.480
You once told me

36:44.120 --> 36:45.520
land equalization is a grave state affair,

36:46.160 --> 36:47.040
and since ancient times,

36:47.280 --> 36:48.520
it has never been achieved without bloodshed.

36:49.480 --> 36:50.560
In Tongzhou this time,

36:51.080 --> 36:51.680
it nearly cost

36:51.680 --> 36:53.040
Grandma half her life.

36:55.600 --> 36:56.320
I am afraid...

36:58.320 --> 36:59.120
I...

37:02.240 --> 37:03.240
I beg you to

37:03.520 --> 37:04.480
let my Grandma

37:04.720 --> 37:06.520
retire from all land equalization duties.

37:07.440 --> 37:08.840
I can take over all

37:09.080 --> 37:10.520
of Grandma's responsibilities.

37:11.080 --> 37:12.560
If blood must be shed,

37:13.200 --> 37:14.280
let it be mine.

37:15.960 --> 37:16.640
You?

37:20.560 --> 37:21.400
You cannot take the place

37:21.400 --> 37:22.360
of your Grandma.

37:23.120 --> 37:23.920
I can!

37:24.440 --> 37:25.560
Everyone knows

37:25.720 --> 37:26.840
Grandma dotes on me most.

37:27.320 --> 37:28.120
If I stand forth

37:28.320 --> 37:29.800
on behalf of Grandma and the Jis,

37:30.040 --> 37:31.160
all will trust me.

37:31.680 --> 37:32.320
Furthermore,

37:32.560 --> 37:33.920
whether it be contacting local gentry,

37:34.240 --> 37:35.560
or planning calculations,

37:35.760 --> 37:36.520
I am fully capable.

37:37.520 --> 37:39.560
I know the lands of Beizhili well.

37:39.840 --> 37:41.160
If there is anything I do not know,

37:41.600 --> 37:42.840
I can consult my Grandma.

37:43.440 --> 37:44.560
Listening to you,

37:45.000 --> 37:46.600
one would think land equalization

37:46.840 --> 37:47.960
is a trivial matter

37:48.120 --> 37:49.000
anyone can do.

37:49.160 --> 37:50.600
It is surely no easy task,

37:51.240 --> 37:52.040
but

37:52.720 --> 37:53.800
I'm willing to learn.

37:54.280 --> 37:55.360
Grandmother is advanced in years,

37:56.040 --> 37:57.080
her strength fading.

37:57.840 --> 37:59.000
I am still young,

37:59.600 --> 38:00.480
and fear no hardship

38:00.720 --> 38:01.680
in traveling to and fro.

38:02.320 --> 38:03.080
Miss Gu,

38:03.600 --> 38:05.120
this is a matter of imperial court importance,

38:05.280 --> 38:06.080
not a trifling matter.

38:07.880 --> 38:08.440
Chen Yi.

38:09.240 --> 38:09.920
Sir!

38:10.240 --> 38:11.480
Grandma is old,

38:11.920 --> 38:12.720
and she has never

38:12.960 --> 38:14.440
spent a day of peace and leisure.

38:14.800 --> 38:15.560
Please.

38:15.920 --> 38:17.360
spare my grandmother from this toil.

38:17.680 --> 38:18.320
Show her out.

38:19.480 --> 38:20.000
Yes, Sir.

38:20.680 --> 38:21.440
Miss Gu,

38:21.880 --> 38:22.480
this way please.

38:53.200 --> 38:53.880
Sir,

38:54.600 --> 38:55.800
had you not decided

38:55.800 --> 38:57.600
to have Mrs. Ji write down

38:57.600 --> 38:58.560
Tongzhou's experience

38:58.960 --> 39:00.560
and spare her from Beizhili?

39:01.120 --> 39:02.360
This is a matter of great gravity.

39:03.440 --> 39:05.120
I can excuse her from going,

39:05.440 --> 39:06.040
yet I can't yield to her plea.

39:06.040 --> 39:07.200
If I grant her wish after that,

39:07.360 --> 39:08.760
what will the court make of me?

39:09.520 --> 39:10.960
I can't help but feel

39:11.560 --> 39:13.040
you were just teasing Miss Gu.

39:19.680 --> 39:20.520
By the way,

39:21.280 --> 39:23.400
Mrs. Chen asked me the other day

39:23.920 --> 39:25.880
to arrange a marriage for you,

39:26.760 --> 39:28.200
and bid me ask you.

39:31.960 --> 39:32.760
Right,

39:35.800 --> 39:38.120
I heard of the southwest a few days ago.

39:38.720 --> 39:40.280
There seems to be a lead on Xiao Qishan.

39:40.760 --> 39:41.560
I think

39:42.520 --> 39:43.880
you need to go there in person.

39:44.520 --> 39:45.400
Is that okay?

39:46.320 --> 39:47.960
The New Year is coming,

39:48.120 --> 39:49.560
and bandits run rampant in the southwest.

39:51.840 --> 39:52.840
Delay will be dangerous.

39:53.440 --> 39:54.440
Set off tomorrow.

39:59.640 --> 40:00.440
Okay.

40:02.120 --> 40:03.520
Might as well return to my hometown.

40:05.880 --> 40:07.120
Such a petty mind.

40:07.680 --> 40:08.640
Take care of yourself.

40:13.960 --> 40:15.160
Holding such a high office,

40:15.680 --> 40:16.880
yet he remains so petty.

40:17.880 --> 40:19.040
Not even a single room

40:19.040 --> 40:19.840
for discussion.

40:23.040 --> 40:24.000
Xuanqing?

40:24.400 --> 40:25.120
Miss Gu?

40:32.320 --> 40:34.120
I returned to the manor to fetch a few books today,

40:34.520 --> 40:35.280
never expecting

40:35.280 --> 40:36.280
to meet you here.

40:37.880 --> 40:40.040
I came with my grandma

40:40.320 --> 40:41.920
to pay respects to Mrs. Chen.

40:43.800 --> 40:44.720
Xuanqing,

40:45.160 --> 40:46.360
what book are you reading?

40:55.200 --> 40:57.160
Better be deemed cunning than a false loyalist.

40:58.440 --> 41:01.000
Better be unyielding than a worldly conformist.

41:01.000 --> 41:02.080
This book is interesting.

41:02.680 --> 41:03.760
Its criticisms are refreshingly blunt.

41:09.080 --> 41:11.120
Are you in a hurry to read this book?

41:12.200 --> 41:12.600
Xuanqing,

41:13.080 --> 41:13.960
there you are.

41:14.240 --> 41:15.080
I've been searching for you.

41:16.040 --> 41:16.800
Miss Gu.

41:19.640 --> 41:20.360
There's no hurry.

41:21.120 --> 41:22.160
If you like it,

41:22.320 --> 41:23.400
just take it and read it.

41:24.880 --> 41:26.120
Fine, thank you.

41:28.880 --> 41:29.880
I have to go.

41:29.880 --> 41:31.520
My Grandma is waiting for me.

41:32.000 --> 41:32.600
Okay.

41:46.040 --> 41:46.320
Giddy up!

41:47.040 --> 41:47.760
Giddy up!

41:48.800 --> 41:49.120
Giddy up!

41:49.400 --> 41:50.280
Miss Qingpu, wait a moment.

41:51.720 --> 41:52.560
Stop.

41:56.920 --> 41:57.600
Miss Qingpu,

41:57.920 --> 41:58.640
Mr. Chen  sent me

41:58.800 --> 42:00.040
with a letter for Mrs. Ji.

42:15.760 --> 42:16.600
Grandma,

42:17.400 --> 42:19.320
what does the letter read?

42:23.040 --> 42:24.160
It read that

42:25.080 --> 42:26.360
considering my advanced age,

42:26.920 --> 42:28.520
the Jis is excused

42:29.400 --> 42:31.480
from further land equalization affairs.

42:31.960 --> 42:33.280
I just need to record my experience

42:33.640 --> 42:34.920
in a book,

42:35.680 --> 42:37.520
and hand it in to the court.

42:37.680 --> 42:38.360
Really?

42:38.920 --> 42:39.800
That's great!

42:40.760 --> 42:41.720
You can finally

42:42.160 --> 42:43.280
rest from all that traveling and toil.

42:44.400 --> 42:45.000
Yes.

42:46.480 --> 42:47.800
It seems Mr. Chen

42:49.160 --> 42:51.800
does have consideration for the Jis.

43:01.240 --> 43:02.560
Grandma returns

43:03.800 --> 43:05.200
to Tongzhou tomorrow,

43:05.200 --> 43:06.360
and you need to get up early.

43:07.320 --> 43:09.000
Xuanqing never set a fixed date

43:09.000 --> 43:10.280
for the book's return.

43:10.600 --> 43:11.600
Why stay up

43:11.600 --> 43:12.920
poring over it by lamp light?

43:13.200 --> 43:14.760
You'll strain your eyes.

43:15.720 --> 43:16.680
Now that Grandma

43:16.680 --> 43:18.280
can head back to Tongzhou safe and sound,

43:18.560 --> 43:19.600
my heart is at peace too.

43:20.480 --> 43:21.520
But for this book,

43:21.680 --> 43:22.440
Xuanqing went all the way back

43:22.440 --> 43:24.080
from the academy just to fetch it.

43:25.160 --> 43:26.600
It must matter.

43:27.000 --> 43:28.520
He kindly lent it to me,

43:28.960 --> 43:30.680
and I cannot be ungrateful.

43:31.320 --> 43:32.680
I must finish it quickly

43:32.920 --> 43:33.680
and return it to him.

43:38.640 --> 43:39.640
What are you laughing at?

43:41.200 --> 43:43.440
I'm laughing at how you keep saying "he" about Xuanqing.

43:43.960 --> 43:45.720
You've said it three times.

43:47.240 --> 43:48.160
I'm just saying.

43:48.840 --> 43:50.000
Hurry and grind the ink.
